<title>THAILAND: Thailand awards seven offshore banking licences.</title>
<headline>Thailand awards seven offshore banking licences.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1996-12-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Thai finance ministry said on Wednesday it would issue new offshore banking licences for seven foreign banks under the Bangkok International Banking Facility (BIBF).</p>
<p>The ministry said licences would be granted to Fuji Bank Ltd, Tokai Bank Ltd, the Royal Bank of Canada, the Korea Development Bank, the National Australia Bank Ltd, Generale Bank and Union Bank of Switzerland.</p>
<p>The seven licensed banks were among 23 foreign applicants seeking to undertake offshore banking business in Thailand, a ministry statement said.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662) 652-0642</p>
</text>
